VirtualBox Network Requirements

Ensure all three VMs are configured with:

Adapter 1: NAT (for internet access)
Adapter 2: Host-Only Adapter (or Bridged Adapter) for inter-node communication

Assign static IPs on the second adapter, for example:

kmaster   192.168.1.10
kworker1  192.168.1.11
kworker2  192.168.1.12

Update /etc/hosts on all nodes:

192.168.1.10 kmaster
192.168.1.11 kworker1
192.168.1.12 kworker2

This setup provides a stable networking foundation for Kubernetes on VirtualBox.

